<title>USA: Associated Banc-Corp, Centra close merger.</title>
<headline>Associated Banc-Corp, Centra close merger.</headline>
<dateline>GREEN BAY, Wis. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Associated Banc-Corp said it completed its merger with Centra Financial Inc in a stock swap worth an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>Centra stockholders received two shares of Associated common stock for each Centra share, the companies said.</p>
<p>Centra's banking offices in West Allis and Pewaukee, Wisconsin, fill niches where Associated does not currently do business, the companies said.</p>
<p>Associated specializes in providing financial services to individuals and small- to mid-sized businesses.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
